+Media credits
+=============
+
+- `coffee-pouring.mp4`: [Cup being filled with coffee in a coffee machine](https://mixkit.co/free-stock-video/cup-being-filled-with-coffee-in-a-coffee-machine-41865/), Mixkit, 720px download.
+- `coffee-roasting.mp4`: [Coffee roaster in operation](https://mixkit.co/free-stock-video/coffee-roaster-in-operation-88001/), Mixkit, 720px download.
+- Both clips use the [Mixkit Stock Video Free License](https://mixkit.co/license/#videoFree). JPEG posters are frames extracted from their respective clips.
+- Featured audio streams the unmodified [Home Coffee Roasting, part 1](https://hackerpublicradio.org/eps/hpr3563/index.html) by dnt, Hacker Public Radio episode 3563, under [CC BY-SA 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). The homepage links to its episode notes, credits, and license.
+
+Loading behavior
+----------------
+
+`media.js` assigns `data-src` and `data-poster` only when the containing player is within 200px of the viewport (or receives keyboard/pointer interaction). Until then, media uses `preload="none"` with no active source, poster, or artwork URL. On approach, players preload metadata without autoplaying. The fallback uses scroll/resize geometry checks when IntersectionObserver is unavailable. No media preload hints or CSS background images bypass this gate.
+
+Run `npm test` for the static markup and loader regression checks. No build step is required.
